<body>
    <h1>Organization-Service: Technical Documentation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 local-id=3D"d24264f8-69e1-44ab-b577-5e484ae80cfb" id=3D"Organiz=
ation-Service:TechnicalDocumentation-1.Overview">1. Overview</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f189e755-9b18-4f0a-90c3-9063f49cd230">The organization-servi=
ce manages all organization-centric data and operations, including organiza=
tion creation, updates, deletion, organization-user and organization-device=
 mappings, and organization metadata. Authentication and roles are handled =
by dedicated services.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"3607c427-e136-44ea-9e01-d83c66a86f42" id=3D"Organization-Se=
rvice:TechnicalDocumentation-2.OrganizationFlows">2. Organization Flows</h3=
>
<h4 local-id=3D"7b577f48-fed7-460b-bac7-d28a99e9bb03" id=3D"Organization-Se=
rvice:TechnicalDocumentation-a.OrganizationLifecycle">a. Organization Lifec=
ycle</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"1b03b0b6-5c6c-422d-8db4-190b0bc5f2b7">
<li local-id=3D"55ab4519-bb82-4be7-82e2-8c3b5a6b22b5">
<p local-id=3D"3374c750-1a7d-45c5-a9de-223d01e1ca99"><strong>Create Organiz=
ation</strong>: Admin or system creates a new organization via API.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"8acb6301-379d-4ede-b70f-f0daa152d6bc">
<p local-id=3D"84536bc2-01c3-42a4-8faa-9a196547c6cd"><strong>Get Organizati=
on</strong>: Retrieve organization details by organizationId.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d135cca3-6d46-4911-aaa4-4f7652cc34cb">
<p local-id=3D"5a60588c-ef3c-47c6-a6c8-125160486ef2"><strong>Update Organiz=
ation</strong>: Update organization profile, settings, or metadata.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"f096f745-f916-48cb-bc3f-c09250430bfd">
<p local-id=3D"c6839027-d0cb-475a-9e63-01cf0b1db13a"><strong>Delete Organiz=
ation</strong>: Remove an organization (soft or hard delete).</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"f0dc07f6-c85e-47c9-b2fe-561322ec73f2" id=3D"Organization-Se=
rvice:TechnicalDocumentation-b.Organization-UserMapping">b. Organization-Us=
er Mapping</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"7e75412a-b32a-470a-b0bc-4d409778d7e7">
<li local-id=3D"cd10cdd6-0333-4c3d-9178-94a22346fe2a">
<p local-id=3D"10757ed3-cf4d-4a6c-9302-7f7890c8fa69"><strong>Assign User to=
 Organization</strong>: Add a user to an organization.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"544cc741-08a1-4533-a254-8e74b40d88bc">
<p local-id=3D"44ee4093-5e2f-42f7-b979-ba4c424de0b1"><strong>Remove User fr=
om Organization</strong>: Remove a user from an organization.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3cf4d71c-6193-4249-9e12-6876cc97786d">
<p local-id=3D"331484f3-cb34-4c41-9317-b50b49547ee6"><strong>List Organizat=
ion Users</strong>: List all users belonging to an organization.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"7be2f39c-20bf-4e9f-9197-bbfcd7181283" id=3D"Organization-Se=
rvice:TechnicalDocumentation-c.Organization-DeviceMapping">c. Organization-=
Device Mapping</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"07048d68-2c79-47ee-b8ad-5c6ecd4b2718">
<li local-id=3D"dd7bba73-794a-4188-ab97-279a90142a1e">
<p local-id=3D"ce355977-26d9-4a22-9d79-accff9a77e50"><strong>Assign Device =
to Organization</strong>: Add a device to an organization.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6b231ccd-b2d1-4006-9f8b-9ce343dd2f9b">
<p local-id=3D"b6143149-1e2c-4cb6-a515-1ec425aaecad"><strong>Remove Device =
from Organization</strong>: Remove a device from an organization.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"606ff866-f5a0-41a9-be33-55162eb9e6e2">
<p local-id=3D"8deb40e5-8107-46af-ba6f-c2a1bf87876f"><strong>List Organizat=
ion Devices</strong>: List all devices assigned to an organization.</p></li=
>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"229f59eb-047f-4988-b57e-ab263ead40a1" id=3D"Organization-Se=
rvice:TechnicalDocumentation-d.OrganizationMetadata&amp;Events">d. Organiza=
tion Metadata &amp; Events</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"93aacf4d-4758-438b-9d1f-41232744f02c">
<li local-id=3D"e5413d99-877b-4264-a683-a58d4176f717">
<p local-id=3D"6c11248b-1f26-41ef-8e78-2a3bdf1cd875"><strong>Update Metadat=
a</strong>: Store or update custom organization metadata.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ee440e7c-394f-44dd-8aae-d2a374db933f">
<p local-id=3D"c8963d20-af11-4a11-b7c3-3b5e0f84dafd"><strong>Organization C=
hange Events</strong>: DynamoDB Streams trigger audit, analytics, or notifi=
cation Lambdas.</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
